<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="icon.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="style.css">
    <title>我的电脑 - Windows 98</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #008080;
            font-family: "MS Sans Serif", Tahoma, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #008080 25%, #00a0a0 25%, #00a0a0 50%, #008080 50%, #008080 75%, #00a0a0 75%, #00a0a0);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
        }
        .win98-window {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 680px;
            height: 480px;
            background: #c0c0c0;
            border: 2px solid #dfdfdf;
            border-right-color: #808080;
            border-bottom-color: #808080;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .title-bar {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #000080, #1084d0);
            color: white;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: move;
        }
        .title-bar-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        .title-btn {
            width: 22px;
            height: 18px;
            background: #c0c0c0;
            border: 1px solid #dfdfdf;
            border-right-color: #808080;
            border-bottom-color: #808080;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 14px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .window-content {
            padding: 12px;
            height: calc(100% - 32px);
            background: #c0c0c0;
            border-top: 2px solid #dfdfdf;
        }
        .content-area {
            background: white;
            border: 2px inset #c0c0c0;
            height: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            overflow: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="win98-window">
    <div class="title-bar">
        <span>我的电脑 - Windows 98</span>
        <div class="title-bar-buttons">
            <div class="title-btn">_</div>
            <div class="title-btn">□</div>
            <div class="title-btn">×</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="window-content">
        <div class="content-area">
            <h2 style="margin-top: 10px; color: #000080;">欢迎来到 Windows 98 风格空间！</h2>
            <p>这里是 NinJATE 特别制作的复古区域。</p>
            <p>💾 硬盘空间还很充足...</p>
            <p>🖱️ 请尽情探索这个充满 nostalgia 的小角落。</p>
            <br>
            <p style="text-align: center; color: #808080; font-size: 14px;">
                「Made with love for the 90s」<br>
                1998 - 2026
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
